  "football_data_format": "football-data.co.uk file family of football_data_code: 'mmz4281' = per-season files /mmz4281/{season}/{code}.csv, 'new' = one all-seasons file /new/{code}.csv. Equals the model_type family for model leagues; for model_type null leagues it is what lets the HT-extra download read them (data_loader). Big-5 codes copied from data_loader._HT_EXTRA (6aa2351e), SWZ/POL from the deleted Pro backfill dict (round-1 fix summary).",
  "odds_api_props": "true ONLY where OddsAPI has actually returned player props for the league's sport key (output/prop_odds_coverage.json, priced_events > 0 on 2026-11-02); false where OddsAPI was probed and never priced a prop, and where it was never asked.",
  "season_rule_null": "season_rule may be null only for a collection-only entry with no model and no API-Football id whose season convention no repo source holds; the season resolves to SEASON_UNKNOWN."
